# Skill `resources/` and `references/` directories hold LLM-prompt content —
# reviewer personas, knowledge files, embedded code examples, checklists, and
# bracket notation (e.g. arr[i], [CRITICAL], [ ]). These are not rendered prose,
# so Markdown doc-lint rules like no-undefined-references produce only noise here.
# Authored docs (README, SKILL.md, POWER.md, GEMINI.md) are still linted.
plugins/*/skills/*/resources/
plugins/*/skills/*/references/

# Captured evaluation responses are evidence; preserve their original Markdown.
# Authored protocols, assessments, and result summaries remain linted.
plugins/spec-skills/evals/effectiveness/results/**/runs/**/response.md
